@lang en
IMPORT `tasco-ch1-contract`

-- Chương I: the rights and duties of Tasco (Điều 4) and of the buyer and owner (Điều 5), and the
-- assessment of a loss (Điều 7).
-- Quotations (`src:N`) are generated from line N of ../../source/raw/tasco-combined-motor-2024.txt.
-- The OCR sets the clause numbers of these pages apart from their text (src:210-236, 297-326,
-- 370-385), so each block below says in a comment which numbered clause it is.
--
-- PERIODS. Calendar days (fork F7). A DEONTIC's WITHIN is that many days from the event that
-- opens it, and the day count is inclusive at both edges (`WITHIN 15`: day 15 is in time).
-- A duty to act "ngay" (immediately) carries no WITHIN: the rules give it no number (fork F9).
-- A duty with no period carries no WITHIN either; it stands until performed.

§ `Chương I — general provisions: rights and duties`

§§ `Điều 4 — Tasco's rights and duties`

