GIVEN `Tasco refused to reduce the premium` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party` `An act under the rules`
`art 5.1.4 — the buyer may suspend the contract if Tasco refuses` `Tasco refused to reduce the premium` MEANS
    IF   `Tasco refused to reduce the premium`
    THEN PARTY `the buyer`
