-- src:467 | hướng dẫn của Bảo hiểm Tasco
@ref Rules, Điều 7.4 (src:463-467)
GIVEN `Tasco cannot assess, or there is no police accident report` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party` `An act under the rules`
`art 7.4 — the owner must gather and supply the details of the loss` `Tasco cannot assess, or there is no police accident report` MEANS
    IF   `Tasco cannot assess, or there is no police accident report`
    THEN PARTY `the owner`
         MUST  `gather and supply the details, documents and photographs of the loss`
         HENCE FULFILLED
    ELSE FULFILLED
